{"4994380": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Tidy Town", "steam_appid": 4994380, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine everyday objects to restore beautiful spaces and make a sleepy town bloom again. Help Percy lend a paw one room at a time as he saves a friend’s cafe, rebuilds a city park, refreshes an artist’s studio and tidies his way across town and into his community's heart.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4994380/extras/0fff6cd1f734de33c9c94b22e84b6636.webp?t=1787869076\" width=259 height=31 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4994380/extras/746f12f76a549a46486ad7ad99a587ff.poster.avif?t=1787869076\" width=780 height=204 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4994380/extras/746f12f76a549a46486ad7ad99a587ff.webm?t=1787869076\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4994380/extras/746f12f76a549a46486ad7ad99a587ff.mp4?t=1787869076\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Collect everyday objects and combine matching items into something new as piles of clutter slowly become neat, organized spaces.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4994380/extras/c55ba9462bc403ab9a4e94e6f406c5c0.webp?t=1787869076\" width=193 height=24 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop 